    count: 19-56 objects, sizes 1-8 pixels, bbox at most 3x3
    pixel_fraction: 18-35%
  background: 17-23% of pixels [observed]
  symmetry: normalized grid (teal -> source_color) is transpose-symmetric (grid == grid.T) [observed]
  wallpaper: the row-type sequence and column-type sequence are identical (consequence of transpose symmetry)
  teal_templates:
    count: 1-2 template objects, 1-2 distinct shapes
    pixel_count: 2-5 per template, bbox at most 3x3
  matching: source objects matching any template shape = 3-6 (additional to templates themselves)
  rule: >
    Find 8-connected teal objects as shape templates. Among source-color objects,
    find all with matching normalized mask. Recolor those to teal. Only one non-bg
